# Bot2's Chains of Mephistopheles replaces a draw of Bot1's own Ancestral Recall with a discard. The discard is the replacement
# effect's, so an ability Bot2 controls causes it (CR 614.1a, 609.1), and the Wilt-Leaf Liege Bot1 discards this way is
# put onto the battlefield instead of into its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ancestral Recall
Wilt-Leaf Liege
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Swamp
Chains of Mephistopheles
Swamp x20

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Chains of Mephistopheles.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Choose(Wilt-Leaf Liege)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Wilt-Leaf Liege
